## ============================================================
## PG 시뮬레이터 직접 호출 (디버깅/확인용)
## 포트: 8082
## ============================================================

### 결제 요청 (시뮬레이터에 직접)
POST {{pg-simulator}}/api/v1/payments
X-USER-ID: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "26031800000001",
  "cardType": "SAMSUNG",
  "cardNo": "1234-5678-9012-3456",
  "amount": "10000",
  "callbackUrl": "http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments/callback"
}

### transactionKey로 결제 조회
GET {{pg-simulator}}/api/v1/payments/20260318:TR:xxxxxx
X-USER-ID: 1

### orderId로 결제 목록 조회
GET {{pg-simulator}}/api/v1/payments?orderId=26031800000001
X-USER-ID: 1
